        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage JH Series Barcelona Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Barcelona has a classic oval design with elegant, curved lines; it features two small oval faces and a graceful sweeping handle. The two-piece design offers flexibility for doors with nonstandard hole locations while providing a subtle classic appearance for entranceways. A dummy handleset it is non-functional meaning that it does not latch or lock.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDummy Handlesets are for looks only. They do not lock and do not latch. They are most often used as a pull or to match trim.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/barcelona-single-cylinder-handleset-schlage-jh60bar\"><b>Barcelona Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Dexter Barcelona Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc-based material plated to match the finish you choose.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>5 year finish warranty.</li>\r\n<li>25 year mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Schlage Barcelona Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Outside Handleset Length: 11-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Handleset Projection: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dummy Handleset is non-functional</b>. Just for looks, it is used on inactive doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
